      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I've heard that the area around \r\n[<SPOT 931>]\r\nin [<AREA 14>] is perfect for a stroll.\r\nIn particular, it seems that the flowers\r\nin front of the \"Nameless Gravestone\" are\r\nbeautiful. Shall we take a commemorative\r\nphoto and create some good memories?",
        "Jp" : "《<AREA 14>》の《<SPOT 931>》の辺りは\r\n散歩にぴったりだと聞きました\r\n特に、\"名も無き墓標\"の前は花が綺麗だそうですよ\r\n記念撮影をして、良い思い出を作りませんか？"
      },
