      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "In [<AREA 14>], the vicinity of\r\nthe \"Nameless Gravestone\" at \r\n[<SPOT 931>]\r\nis said to have lovely flowers. I think\r\nit would be delightful to go for a\r\nwalk and take some photos together.\r\nWhat do you think?",
        "Jp" : "《<AREA 14>》の《<SPOT 931>》にある\r\n\"名も無き墓標\"の辺りは花がきれいだそうです\r\nお散歩して、一緒に写真を撮ったりできたら\r\n楽しいと思うんですが――い、いかがですか？"
      },
