      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Master, training outdoors feels quite nice.\r\nLet's race to [<SPOT 931>]\r\n in [<AREA 14>]!\r\nWhen we arrive, let's take a\r\ncommemorative photo in front of the\r\n\"Nameless Gravestone,\" known for its\r\nbeautiful flowers!",
        "Jp" : "マスター、屋外での鍛錬も気持ちの良いものですよ\r\n《<AREA 14>》の《<SPOT 931>》まで\r\n競争しましょう！　着いたら、花がきれいだと噂の\r\n\"名も無き墓標\"の前で、ぜひ記念写真を！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 542425,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
