        "En" : "I've heard that [<AREA 14>] 's\r\n[<SPOT 931>] is ideal for a\r\nbrief rest. I recommend we go\r\ntogether and take a memorable\r\nphoto in front of the\r\nbeautiful \"Nameless Gravestone.\"",
        "Jp" : "《<AREA 14>》の《<SPOT 931>》は、\r\n軽休憩に最適とのこと\r\n共に訪れ、花が見事な\"名も無き墓標\"の前で\r\n記念撮影を行うといった気分転換を進言する"
